        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Hello there - this is the god of chaos, parties, and randomness:
          Happi!!  For the viewer reading this \u2013 damn\u2026 who would have guessed
          you\u2019d get in here, huh?  Well, to save you some trouble, I decided
          to just teleport the key out here and leave the necromancer in that room. 
          You're welcome. Enjoy the demo!\r\n\r\n"
        type: 0
